.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH devin-rm 1  "rm " 
.SH NAME
devin\-rm \- Delete a session by id or name
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin rm\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITARGET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a session by id or name
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Skip the confirmation prompt
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
Session id or name, or an unambiguous id prefix
